{"id":"hushai","name":"Hushai","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:hushai"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Hushai","text":"Quick, “the Archite,” “the king’s friend” (1 Chr. 27:33). When David fled from Jerusalem, on account of the rebellion of Absalom, and had reached the summit of Olivet, he there met Hushai, whom he sent back to Jerusalem for the purpose of counteracting the influence of Ahithophel, who had joined the ranks of Absalom (2 Sam. 15:32, 37; 16:16-18). It was by his advice that Absalom refrained from immediately pursuing after David. By this delay the cause of Absalom was ruined, for it gave David time to muster his forces."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2365","lemma":"חוּשַׁי","xlit":"Chûwshay","gloss":"Chushai, an Israelite","kjv":"Hushai","count":6,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H4428","lemma":"מֶלֶךְ","xlit":"melek","gloss":"a king","kjv":"king, royal","count":4,"share":0.33}],"verses":["2Sam.15.32","2Sam.15.37","2Sam.16.16","2Sam.16.17","2Sam.16.18","1Chr.27.33","2Sam.15.33","2Sam.15.34","2Sam.15.35","2Sam.15.36","2Sam.16.19","2Sam.17.0"],"related":[{"id":"zadok","type":"cooccur","shared":5,"jaccard":0.093,"why":"5 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"diplomacy","type":"cooccur","shared":10,"jaccard":0.05,"why":"10 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"strategy","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.046,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"friendship","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.028,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"deception","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.028,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"absalom","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"},{"id":"ahaz","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"},{"id":"amnesty","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"},{"id":"ar","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"},{"id":"arad","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"},{"id":"ashtaroth","type":"lexical","strong":"H4428","why":"both lead with מֶלֶךְ (H4428)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":7,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntVII.9","count":7,"book":"Ant. 7","title":"Concerning The Insurrection Of Absalom Against David And Concerning Ahithophel And Hushai; And Concerning Ziba And Shimei; And How Ahithophel Hanged Himself."}]}]}
